hadiths[122]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2899","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Hajj aur umre ko aik doosre ke peeche karo; kyunke in donon ko lagataar karna faqr aur gunahon ko aise door karta hai jaise bhatti lohe ke zang ko door karti hai."
"2900","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Hajj aur umre ko aik doosre ke peeche karo; kyunke ye donon gunahon ko aise door karte hain jaise bhatti lohe ke zang ko door karti hai."
"2901","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Hajj aur umre ko aik doosre ke peeche karo; kyunke ye donon faqr aur gunahon ko aise door karte hain jaise bhatti lohe, sone aur chandi ke zang ko door karti hai; aur Hajj-e-Mabroor ka sawab jannat ke siwa kuch nahi."
"2902","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Oont apne malik ke paas apni behtareen haalat mein aayenge agar us ne un mein un ka haq ada na kiya ho; wo use apne khuron se raundenge. Aur bakriyan apne malik ke paas apni behtareen haalat mein aayengi agar us ne un mein un ka haq ada na kiya ho; wo use apne khuron se raundengi aur apne seengon se maarengi. Aur un ka haq ye hai ke unhein paani par doha jaye. Khabardar, qayamat ke din tum mein se koi mere paas oont lekar na aaye jise wo apni gardan par uthaye hue ho aur wo renga raha ho, phir wo kahe: Ae Muhammad! To main kahun: Main tumhare liye kuch ikhtiyar nahi rakhta, maine pahuncha diya tha. Khabardar, qayamat ke din tum mein se koi mere paas bakri lekar na aaye jise wo apni gardan par uthaye hue ho aur wo mainmain kar rahi ho, phir wo kahe: Ae Muhammad! To main kahun: Main tumhare liye kuch ikhtiyar nahi rakhta, maine pahuncha diya tha. Aur tum mein se kisi ka khazana qayamat ke din ganje saanp ban jayega jis se us ka malik bhagega aur wo use talash karega: Main tumhara khazana hun; pas wo musalsal us ke peeche rahega yahan tak ke us ki ungli ko apne munh mein le lega."
"2903","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se har aurat apna paani aur beri ke patte le, phir paak ho aur taharat khoob achchi kare; phir apne sar par paani daale aur use zor se male yahan tak ke sar ki khaal tak pahunch jaye; phir apne upar paani daale; phir mushk laga hua ru'i ka phaha le aur us se taharat kare."
"2904","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Musalmanon ke sadqe un ke paani ke ghaton par liye jayenge."
"2905","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aag ibn Adam ko kha jayegi siwa sajde ke nishan ke; Allah azzawajal ne aag par haraam kar diya hai ke sajde ka nishan khaye."
"2906","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sone ko chandi se jaise chaho becho aur chandi ko sone se jaise chaho becho."
"2907","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sone aur chandi ke liye halaakat ho."
"2908","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhara apne bhai ke chehre par muskurana tumhare liye sadqa hai; tumhara neki ka hukm dena aur burayi se rokna sadqa hai; tumhara gumrahi ki zameen mein aadmi ko raasta batana tumhare liye sadqa hai; tumhara pathar, kaanta aur haddi ko raaste se hatana tumhare liye sadqa hai; aur tumhara apne dol se apne bhai ke dol mein paani daalna tumhare liye sadqa hai."
"2909","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Juma ke din farishte masjid ke darwazon par bheje jate hain jo pehle aane walon ko tartib se likhte hain; phir jab imam mimbar par charhta hai to saheefe lapet diye jate hain."
"2910","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qibla ki taraf thook qayamat ke din uthaya jayega jabke wo us ke malik ke chehre par hoga."
"2911","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Momin ke zevar wahan tak pahunchenge jahan tak wuzu ka paani pahunchta hai."
"2912","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Rehnumayi ki bastiyan Ihaab tak pahunchegi."
"2913","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum Madina ko us ki behtareen haalat mein chhor doge, use darinde ke siwa koi nahi aayega; aur sab se aakhir mein hashr mein Muzaina qabile ke do charwahe uthenge jo Madina ka qasd karenge aur apni bakriyon ko hankte hue use ujra hua payenge, yahan tak ke jab Saniyyat-ul-Wida par pahunchenge to apne munhon ke bal gir padenge."
"2914","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sharafat walon ki khataon ki saza se darguzar karo."
"2915","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Juma har musalman par wajib hai siwa aurat, bachche ya ghulam ke."
"2916","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum logon ko kaanon ki tarah paoge; pas jahiliyyat mein jo un mein behtar the, Islam mein bhi behtar hain jab deen ki samajh hasil karein. Aur tum is muamle mein sab se behtar us ko paoge jo us mein parne se pehle use sab se zyada napasand karta ho. Aur tum qayamat ke din Allah ke nazdeek sab se bure aadmi ko do chehron wala paoge: jo in ke paas aik chehre se aata hai aur un ke paas doosre chehre se aata hai."
"2917","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Namaz mein takhfeef karo; kyunke tumhare peeche kamzor, boodha aur haajatmand hai."
"2918","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qayamat se pehle aik hawa aayegi, pas us mein har momin ki rooh qabz kar li jayegi."
"2919","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aag aur jannat ne bahas ki; aag ne kaha: Mujhe mutakabbiron aur jabbbaron se nawaza gaya; aur jannat ne kaha: Mujhe kiya hai ke mere andar kamzor log, gire-pare aur aajiz hi dakhil hote hain? To Allah azzawajal ne jannat se farmaya: Tu to meri rehmat hai, main tere zariye apne bandon mein se jis par chahun rehem karta hun; aur aag se farmaya: Tu to mera azab hai, main tere zariye apne bandon mein se jis par chahun azab karta hun; aur tum donon mein se har aik ka bharna mere zimme hai. Rahi aag to wo tab tak nahi bharegi jab tak Allah us par apna qadam na rakhe; to wo kahegi: Bas bas; tab wo bhar jayegi aur us ka aik hissa doosre se simat jayega; pas Allah apni makhlooq mein se kisi par zulm nahi karega. Aur rahi jannat to Allah us ke liye makhlooq paida karega."
"2920","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Shab-e-Qadr ko talash karo; pas jo use talash kare wo use sattaiswein raat mein talash kare."
"2921","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Shab-e-Qadr ko aakhri saat raaton mein talash karo."
"2922","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Shab-e-Qadr ko Ramazan ke aakhri ashray ki taaq raaton mein talash karo."
"2923","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Shab-e-Qadr ko taeiswein raat mein talash karo."
"2924","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum nange paon, nange badan aur baghair khatna uthaye jaoge."
"2925","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Saye ki taraf muntaqil ho jao.. ..."
"2926","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apni us jagah se hat jao jahan tumhein ghaflat ne aa liya tha."
"2927","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Dabba nikalega aur logon ki naakon par nishan lagayega; phir wo tumhare darmiyan umar guzarega yahan tak ke aadmi sawari khareedega to kaha jayega: Kis se khareedi? To wo kahega: Naak par nishan lage hue aadmi se."
"2928","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apne nutfon ke liye chunao karo; pas barabari walon se nikah karo aur unhein rishta do."
"2929","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Gaayon ke doodh se ilaaj karo; kyunke main ummeed rakhta hun ke Allah un mein shifa rakhega; kyunke wo har darakht mein se khati hain."
"2930","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ilaaj karo ae Allah ke bando; kyunke Allah taala ne koi bimari nahi rakhi magar us ki dawa rakhi hai, siwa aik bimari ke: burhapa."
"2931","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aankh roti hai aur dil ghamgeen hai, aur ham wahi kahenge jo Rab ko raazi kare; aur Allah ki qasam ae Ibrahim, ham tumhari judai se ghamgeen hain."
"2932","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aankh roti hai aur dil ghamgeen hai, aur ham wahi kahenge jo Rab ko naraaz na kare; aur agar ye sachcha wada, jama karne wala waqt aur ye na hota ke ham mein se pichhla pehle ke peeche jayega to ham tum par ae Ibrahim is se zyada gham karte jitna ham ne kiya hai; aur ham tumhari wajah se ae Ibrahim ghamgeen hain."
"2933","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qayamat ke din suraj makhlooq ke qareeb ho jayega yahan tak ke un se meel ke faasle par hoga; pas log paseene mein apne aamaal ke mu'tabiq honge; koi takhnon tak hoga, koi ghutnon tak hoga, koi kamar tak hoga, aur koi aisa hoga jise paseena lagaam ki tarah jakre hue hoga."
"2934","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Islam ki chaki paintees ya chhattees ya saintees tak ghoomegi; pas agar wo halak hon to halak hone walon ke raaste par; aur agar un ka deen un ke liye qaim rahe to guzre hue ke saath un ke liye sattar saal qaim rahega."
"2935","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum khair par khair ko jate hue dekhoge yahan tak ke tum mein se sirf is jaisa baqi reh jayega."
"2936","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri ummat mere paas hauz par aayegi aur main logon ko us se aise hataunga jaise aadmi doosre ke oonton ko apne oonton se hatata hai. Sahaba ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Nabi, kiya aap hamein pehchanenge? Aap ne farmaya: Haan, tumhare liye nishani hogi jo tumhare siwa kisi ke liye nahi; tum mere paas wuzu ke asar se roshan peshani aur roshan haath-pair wale aaoge; aur tum mein se aik giroh ko mujh se rok diya jayega to wo nahi pahunch payenge; to main kahunga: Ae mere Rab, ye mere sathiyon mein se hain! To aik farishta mujhe jawab dega aur kahega: Kiya tum jaante ho unhon ne tumhare baad kiya naya kaam kiya?"
"2937","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maine tumhare darmiyan do cheezein chhori hain, un ke baad tum kabhi gumrah nahi hoge: Allah ki kitaab aur meri sunnat; aur ye donon juda nahi honge yahan tak ke mere paas hauz par aayenge."
"2938","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Nikah karo chahe lohe ki angoothi ke ewaz."
"2939","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kunwariyon se nikah karo; kyunke un ke munh zyada meethe, un ke rehem zyada bachche dene wale aur thore par zyada raazi hone wale hain."
"2940","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mohabbat karne wali, zyada bachche dene wali aurton se nikah karo; kyunke main tum se ummaton par fakhr karunga."
"2941","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Nikah karo; kyunke main tum se ummaton par fakhr karunga; aur Nasara ki rahbaniyyat jaise na bano."
"2942","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Yateem larki se us ke nafs ke baare mein ijazat li jayegi; pas agar wo khamosh rahe to yehi us ki ijazat hai; aur agar inkar kare to us par koi nikah nahi."
"2943","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sehri karo; kyunke sehri mein barkat hai."
"2944","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sehri karo chahe paani se."
"2945","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sehri karo chahe paani ke aik ghoont se."
"2946","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aadmi ka aik ungli se salam karna jis se wo ishara kare, Yahudiyon ka fail hai."
"2947","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum sunoge aur tum se suna jayega, aur un se suna jayega jo tum se sun-te hain."
"2948","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere naam par naam rakho aur meri kunniyat par kunniyat na rakho."
"2949","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere naam par naam rakho aur meri kunniyat par kunniyat na rakho; kyunke main to Abul Qasim hun, tumhare darmiyan taqseem karta hun."
"2950","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sadqa karo; kyunke tum par aik zamana aayega ke aadmi apna sadqa lekar chalega to jis ke paas wo use layega wo kahega: Agar tum ise kal laye hote to main ise qubool kar leta; raha ab to mujhe is ki koi haajat nahi; pas wo koi na payega jo use qubool kare."
"2951","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sadqa karo chahe khajoor se; kyunke ye bhooke ko rok deti hai aur gunah ko aise bujha deti hai jaise paani aag ko bujha deta hai."
"2952","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sadqa karo aur theli mein bandh kar na rakho, warna tum par bhi bandh diya jayega."
"2953","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aadmi ka apne ghar mein nafl parhna us ke logon ke saamne nafl parhne se aise barha hua hai jaise aadmi ki jama'at mein namaz us ki akele namaz se fazeelat rakhti hai."
"2954","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Hadd ko apne darmiyan maaf kar do; pas jo hadd mere paas pahunch jaye wo wajib ho chuki."
"2955","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aao mujh se baiat karo ke Allah ke saath kisi ko shareek na karoge, chori na karoge, zina na karoge, apni auladon ko qatl na karoge, aisa bohtan na lao ge jo tum apne haathon aur pairon ke darmiyan gharte ho, aur neiki mein meri nafarmani na karoge; pas tum mein se jo wafa kare us ka ajr Allah par hai; aur jo in mein se koi gunah kare phir duniya mein us ki saza pa le to ye us ke liye kaffara hai; aur jo in mein se koi gunah kare phir Allah use chhupa le to us ka muamla Allah ke supurd hai: agar chahe use azab de aur agar chahe use maaf kare."
"2956","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Quran ki hifazat karo; qasam hai us zaat ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai, ye aadmiyon ke dilon se oonton ke apne bandhan se nikal bhagne se zyada nikal bhagne wala hai."
"2957","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Hajj mein jaldi karo; kyunke tum mein se koi nahi jaanta ke use kiya pesh aaye."
"2958","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Logon ke aamaal har Juma mein do baar pesh kiye jate hain: Peer ke din aur Jumeraat ke din; pas har momin bande ko bakhsh diya jata hai siwa us bande ke jis ke aur us ke bhai ke darmiyan dushmani ho; to kaha jata hai ke in donon ko chhor do yahan tak ke ye laut aayein."
"2959","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aamaal Peer aur Jumeraat ke din pesh kiye jate hain; pas main chahta hun ke mera amal is haal mein pesh ho ke main roze se hun."
"2960","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Fitne dilon par chaatai ki tarah aik aik karke pesh kiye jayenge; pas jo dil unhein pi le us mein aik kaala nuqta laga diya jayega; aur jo dil un ka inkar kare us mein aik safaid nuqta laga diya jayega; yahan tak ke dil safaid pathar jaise ho jayenge: jab tak aasmaan aur zameen qaim hain unhein koi fitna nuqsan nahi pahuncha sakta; aur doosre siyah maidani pathar ki tarah, ulte ghare ki tarah na neki ko pehchanenge na burayi ka inkar karenge, siwa us ke jo un ki khwahish unhein pila de."
"2961","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khush-haali mein Allah ko pehchano, wo sakhti mein tumhein pehchanega."
"2962","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Deenar ka banda aur dirham ka banda aur qeemti chadar ka banda halaak ho; agar use diya jaye to raazi ho aur agar na diya jaye to naraaz ho; halaak ho aur aundha ho, aur jab use kaanta chubhe to na nikle. Khushkhabri ho us bande ke liye jo Allah ke raaste mein apne ghore ki lagaam pakre hue hai, us ka sar pur-ghubaar hai aur us ke qadam gard-aalood hain; agar wo pehredari mein ho to pehredari mein, aur agar wo pichhle daste mein ho to pichhle daste mein; agar wo ijazat mange to use ijazat na di jaye aur agar sifarish kare to us ki sifarish qubool na ki jaye."
"2963","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Seekh lo ke tum mein se koi apne Rab ko marne se pehle nahi dekhega."
"2964","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ki kitaab seekho, us ki hifazat karo aur use khush-elhaani se parho; qasam hai us zaat ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai, ye doodh dene wali oontniyon ke bandhan se chhootne se zyada chhootne wali hai."
"2965","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apne nasab mein se itna seekho jis se tum apne rishton ko joro; kyunke sila-rehmi ghar walon mein mohabbat, maal mein kasrat aur umar mein barkat hai."
"2966","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Quraish se seekho aur unhein na sikhao; aur Quraish ko aage rakho aur unhein peeche na karo; kyunke Quraishi mein ghair-Quraishi ke do aadmiyon jitni taaqat hai."
"2967","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mustaqil ghar mein bure parosi se Allah ki panah mango; kyunke aane-jane wala parosi tum se door chala jata hai."
"2968","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sakht aazmaish, bad-bakhti ke aa lene, bure faisle aur dushmanon ke khush hone se Allah ki panah mango."
"2969","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum jazeera-e-Arab se ladoge to Allah use fatah karega; phir Faaras se to Allah use fatah karega; phir tum Room se ladoge to Allah use fatah karega; phir tum Dajjal se ladoge to Allah use fatah karega."
"2970","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Peer aur Jumeraat ke din jannat ke darwaze khole jate hain; pas un mein har us bande ko bakhsh diya jata hai jo Allah ke saath kisi ko shareek na karta ho, siwa us aadmi ke jis ke aur us ke bhai ke darmiyan dushmani ho; to kaha jata hai: In donon ko dekho yahan tak ke sulah kar lein."
"2971","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aadhi raat ko aasmaan ke darwaze khole jate hain aur pukarne wala pukarta hai: Kiya koi dua karne wala hai ke us ki dua qubool ki jaye? Kiya koi mangne wala hai ke use diya jaye? Kiya koi museebat-zada hai ke us se takleef door ki jaye? Pas koi musalman nahi rehta jo dua mange magar Allah taala us ki dua qubool karta hai, siwa zina karne wali aurat jo apni sharmgah se kamati hai ya mehsool lene wale ke."
"2972","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Yaman fatah hoga to aik qaum aayegi jo oonton ko hankegi; wo apne ghar walon aur jo un ki itaat kare unhein lekar hijrat karenge, halanke Madina un ke liye behtar hai agar wo jaante; aur Shaam fatah hoga to aik qaum aayegi jo oonton ko hankegi; wo apne ghar walon aur jo un ki itaat kare unhein lekar hijrat karenge, halanke Madina un ke liye behtar hai agar wo jaante; aur Iraq fatah hoga to aik qaum aayegi jo oonton ko hankegi; wo apne ghar walon aur jo un ki itaat kare unhein lekar hijrat karenge, halanke Madina un ke liye behtar hai agar wo jaante."
"2973","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Yajooj aur Majooj khole jayenge aur wo logon par aise niklenge jaise Allah azzawajal ne farmaya: Har bulandi se daurte hue; to wo logon ko gher lenge aur musalman un se hat kar apne shehron aur qilon ki taraf ho jayenge aur apne maweshi apne paas jama kar lenge; aur wo zameen ka paani pi jayenge yahan tak ke un mein se koi neher par se guzrega to us mein jo paani hai pi jayega yahan tak ke use khushk chhor dega; yahan tak ke jo un ke baad guzrega wo us neher par se guzrega to kahega: Kabhi yahan paani tha; yahan tak ke logon mein se koi baqi nahi rahega magar qile ya sheher mein; un mein se kehne wala kahega: Zameen walon se to ham farigh ho chuke, aasmaan wale baqi hain! Phir un mein se aik apna neza hilayega phir use aasmaan ki taraf phenkega to wo us ke paas khoon-aalood wapas aayega aazmaish aur fitne ke liye; pas jab wo is haal mein honge ke Allah azzawajal un ki gardano mein keere paida karega jaise tiddi ke ande jo un ki gardano mein nikalte hain; to wo subah ko mare hue honge ke un ki koi aahat sunayi nahi degi; to musalman kahenge: Kiya koi aadmi hai jo hamare liye apni jaan bech kar dekhe ke is dushman ka kiya bana? To un mein se aik aadmi apne aap ko qurbani ke liye tayyar karke niklega jis ne apni jaan ko qatl hone par aamada kar liya hoga; wo utrega aur unhein aik doosre par mare hue payega; to wo pukarega: Ae musalmanon ki jama'at, khush ho jao, Allah azzawajal ne tumhein tumhare dushman se kaafi kar diya; to wo apne shehron aur qilon se niklenge aur apne maweshi charne ko chhor denge; pas un ke liye koi charagah nahi hogi magar un ke gosht; to wo us par aise khush honge jaise kabhi kisi nabat par jo unhein mili ho itne khush nahi hue."
"2974","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jama'at ki namaz tum mein se kisi ki akele namaz se pachees hisson se fazeelat rakhti hai; aur raat ke farishte aur din ke farishte fajr ki namaz mein jama hote hain."
"2975","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ki ne'maton mein ghaur karo aur Allah ki zaat mein ghaur na karo."
"2976","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ki makhlooq mein ghaur karo aur Allah ki zaat mein ghaur na karo."
"2977","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum Yahudiyon se ladoge aur un par ghalib aaoge yahan tak ke un mein se aik pathar ke peeche chhupega to pathar kahega: Ae Allah ke bande, ye mere peeche Yahudi hai, ise qatl kar do."
"2978","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe chhe cheezon ki zamanat do, main tumhein jannat ki zamanat dunga: jab tum mein se koi baat kare to jhoot na bole; jab wada kare to khilaf na kare; jab amanat rakhi jaye to khayanat na kare; apni nigahein neechi rakho, apne haath roko aur apni sharmgahon ki hifazat karo."
"2979","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ammar ko baghi giroh qatl karega."
"2980","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aage barho aur meri iqtida karo, aur tumhare baad wale tumhari iqtida karein; aur aik qaum musalsal peeche hatti rahegi yahan tak ke Allah unhein peeche kar dega."
"2981","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Haath dhaal ki qeemat mein kaata jayega."
"2982","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Chor ka haath chauthayi deenar ya us se zyada mein kaata jayega."
"2983","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Juma ke din farishte masjidon ke darwazon par baith-te hain aur pehle, doosre aur teesre ko likhte hain; yahan tak ke jab imam nikalta hai to saheefe utha liye jate hain."
"2984","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qayamat qaim hogi aur Roomi logon mein sab se zyada honge."
"2985","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne us ki zamanat li hai jo us ke raaste mein jihad kare: use us ke ghar se siwa us ke raaste mein jihad aur us ke kalimaat ki tasdeeq ke kuch nahi nikaalta: ke wo use jannat mein dakhil karega ya use us ke rehne ki jagah jis se wo nikla tha wapas layega us ajr ya maal-e-ghaneemat ke saath jo use mila."
"2986","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har jhagre ka kaffara do rakaatein hain."
"2987","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Baaz oontniyan shaitanon ke liye hongi aur baaz ghar shaitanon ke liye honge."
"2988","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qayamat ke din zameen aik roti ban jayegi; Jabbar use apne haath se aise ulte ga jaise tum mein se koi safar mein apni roti ulta hai; ye ehl-e-jannat ki ziyafat hogi."
"2989","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Rohein parinde hongi jo darakhton se lag kar rahengi; yahan tak ke jab qayamat ka din hoga to har rooh apne jism mein dakhil hogi."
"2990","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aise hukmaran honge jo kahenge aur unhein jawab nahi diya jayega; wo aag mein aik doosre ke peeche girte hue dakhil honge."
"2991","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhare aur Banil Asfar ke darmiyan sulah hogi to wo tum se ghadari karenge; pas wo tumhari taraf assi jhandon mein charhai karenge, un mein se har jhande ke neeche baara hazaar honge."
"2992","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qayamat se pehle aise din honge jin mein ilm utha liya jayega, jahalat utar aayegi aur harj kasrat se hoga; aur harj qatl hai."
"2993","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qayamat se pehle andheri raat ke tukron jaise fitne honge: aadmi un mein subah momin hoga aur shaam kafir, aur shaam momin hoga aur subah kafir; qaumein apna deen duniya ke saamaan ke ewaz bech dengi."
"2994","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jahannam ke darwazon par pukarne wale honge; jo unhein qubool karke un ki taraf jayega wo use us mein phenk denge; wo hamari khaal ke log honge jo hamari zubanon mein baat karenge; pas musalmanon ki jama'at aur un ke imam ko lazim pakro; phir agar jama'at aur imam na hon to un tamam firqon se alag ho jao chahe tumhein darakht ki jar ko daanton se pakarna pare yahan tak ke tumhein maut aa jaye aur tum isi haal mein ho."
"2995","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Dhund par sulah hogi, dil wapas nahi aayenge jaise pehle the; phir gumrahi ke da'i honge; pas agar tum us din zameen mein Allah ke khalifa ko dekho to use lazim pakro chahe tumhara jism zakhmi ho aur tumhara maal le liya jaye; aur agar use na dekho to zameen mein nikal jao chahe tum is haal mein maro ke darakht ke tane ko munh se pakre hue ho."
"2996","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Zameen apne jigar ke tukre nikal phenkegi: sone aur chandi ke sutoonon jaise; to qaatil aayega aur kahega: Isi ke liye maine qatl kiya; aur rishta kaatne wala aayega aur kahega: Isi ke liye maine apna rishta kaata; aur chor aayega aur kahega: Isi ke liye mera haath kaata gaya; phir wo use chhor denge aur us mein se kuch nahi lenge."
"2997","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Musalmanon ke darmiyan phoot ke waqt aik nikalne wala giroh niklega; use donon firqon mein se haq se zyada qareeb wala qatl karega."
"2998","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Zameen se masah karo; kyunke wo tumhare liye meherban hai."
"2999","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kulli karo aur naak mein paani charhao; aur kaan sar mein se hain."
"3000","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri aankhein soti hain aur mera dil nahi sota."
"3001","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Madad aasmaan se kharch ke mutabiq utarti hai aur sabr museebat ke mutabiq utarta hai."
"3002","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Peshaab se paaki hasil karo; kyunke qabr ka aksar azab usi se hai."
"3003","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aurat se chaar cheezon ke liye nikah kiya jata hai: us ke maal, us ke hasab, us ke husn aur us ke deen ke liye; pas deen wali ko hasil karo, tumhare haath khaak-aalood hon."
"3004","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aik doosre ko tohfe do, mohabbat karoge."
"3005","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala se tauba karo; kyunke main har din us se sau baar tauba karta hun."
"3006","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Oonton ke gosht se wuzu karo aur bakriyon ke gosht se wuzu na karo; aur bakriyon ke baron mein namaz parho aur oonton ke baithne ki jagah mein namaz na parho."
"3007","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Us se wuzu karo jise aag ne chhua ho."
"3008","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Gunah se tauba karne wala us jaise hai jis ka koi gunah nahi."
"3009","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har cheez mein tahammul behtar hai siwa aakhirat ke amal ke."
"3010","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tahammul, miyana-ravi aur achchi waza'-qata' nabuwat ke chaubees hisson mein se aik hissa hai."
"3011","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tahammul Allah ki taraf se hai aur jaldi shaitan ki taraf se."
"3012","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Namaz mein jamahi shaitan ki taraf se hai; pas jab tum mein se koi jamahi le to jitna ho sake roke."
"3013","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jamahi shaitan ki taraf se hai; pas jab tum mein se koi jamahi le to jitna ho sake use roke; kyunke tum mein se jab koi haa kehta hai to shaitan us par hansta hai."
"3014","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ki ne'mat ka charcha karna shukr hai aur use chhorna kufr hai; aur jo thore par shukr nahi karta wo zyada par shukr nahi karta; aur jo logon ka shukr nahi karta wo Allah ka shukr nahi karta; aur jama'at barkat hai aur tafreeqa azab hai."
"3015","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tasbeeh mardon ke liye hai aur taali bajana aurton ke liye."
"3016","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Masjid mein thookna khata hai aur us ka kaffara use chhupana hai."
"3017","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Eid-ul-Fitr mein takbeerein pehli rakaat mein saat aur aakhri mein paanch hain; aur in donon ke baad qiraat hai."
"3018","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Talbeena mareez ke dil ke liye sukoon hai, gham mein se kuch door karta hai."
"3019","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khajoor khajoor se, gehun gehun se, jau jau se aur namak namak se barabar barabar, haath se haath ho; pas jo zyada de ya zyada mange us ne sood khaya, magar jab rangeen mukhtalif hon."
"3020","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tayammum chehre ke liye aik zarb aur hathiyon ke liye aik zarb hai."
